{"sections":[{"slug":"标量扩张","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"标量扩张"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">标量扩张</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"alias":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">诱导模</span>"},"page-title":{"Plain":"“标量扩张”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">标量扩张在几何上对应丛的拉回</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $f\\colon R \\to S$ <span lang=\"zh\">为环同态</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">可视为</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">左</span> $S$) <span lang=\"zh\">右</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于左</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义左</span> $S$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>\n$$\r\nf_! M = S \\otimes_R M,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">称之为诱导模</span> (induced module), <span lang=\"zh\">或标量扩张</span> (extension of scalars).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">标量扩张是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/标量限制","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">标量限制</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的左伴随</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/张量-同态伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">张量</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">同态伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">对于左</span> $S$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $N$,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_S(S\\otimes_R M,N)\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_R(M,\\operatorname{Hom}_S(S,N)).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">视为左</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">右</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $f\\colon R\\to S$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span> $\\varphi\\colon \\operatorname{Spec}S\\to\\operatorname{Spec}R$, <span lang=\"zh\">则标量扩张对应于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/六函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">六函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆像</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\varphi^*\\colon \\operatorname{QCoh}(\\operatorname{Spec}S) \\to \\operatorname{QCoh}(\\operatorname{Spec}R)$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/复化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">复化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是关于</span> $\\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathbb{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的标量扩张</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/张量-同态伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">张量</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">同态伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}